# Engineering standards

Follow the canonical document:

`AgentKit/ENGINEERING_STANDARDS.md`

(when the submodule is present at the product-repo root)

Key constraints:

- Published `@bari77/*` / Core packages only — no `file:` or local `dist` dependencies.
- Lockstep versions for all `@bari77/gc-*` in a given Front.
- Migrations only via `Add-Migration.ps1`; class-based seeds; no seed data in migrations.
- Shared logic → Core or DevKit; game pillars → also update Games.Template.
- Module Federation: `provideGameRemoteKernel` on app.config and exported routes; no `providedIn: "root"` for kernel-dependent services.
- Player / guild / team sheets use workspace grids.
- Never start long-lived servers; never commit/push unless asked.
